    "ref": "U00176",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e155]: \"☛The best spare PSP-S110 Battery,made of best quality grade A+ cell in battery market,build-in special microchip to prevent against short-circuiting,over-charging,over-discharging and over-heating,greatly extended the li-ion battery life.☚For Best Performance:✧Make sure to fully charge and discharge your new battery 3 to 5 cycles✧When the battery is depleted, it may take a few minutes for indicator to show when rechargingSpecifications:* Battery Capacity: 3600 mAh* Battery type: Lithium-ion* Watt-hour:12.96Wh* Voltage Output: 3.6VWhat You Get:1 x 3600mAh High Quality Replacement Battery for PSP-S110.1 x 2 Years Warranty.\""
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00177",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e156]: About this item ❤【HIGH QUALITY GRADE A PREMIUM BATTERY】:This Upgraded Sony PSP-S110 Battery uses Grade A+ rated battery cells with CE and ROHS certification,ensure last over 900 charge cycles. Multiple-protection for safer operation for both user and devices,build-in microchip to prevent over-charging,over-discharging and over-heating. ❤【COMPATIBLE MODELS】:This PSP-S110 Battery Suitable for Sony PSP 1000 PSP-110 Console (NOT Compatible with PSP-2000 or 3000 or PSP Slim). ❤【HOW TO USE】:Using up all the power of battery for the first three times before charging,and then take a full charge,thus the battery can be reached the optimum effect of using.Please remember that its full performance and longevity is only achieved after 3 to 5 complete charge and discharge cycles. ❤【LONG-LASTING REPLACEMENT BATTERY】:Bring your PSP-S110 battery life back to glory and save the money of an upgrade; get from 0% to 100% power in a matter of seconds by simply swapping batteries. ❤【WORRY-FREE WARRANTY】:24 Month Warranty and 30 days Money Back.We take care of all quality-related issues with a REPLACEMENT or REFUND.Please contact our VinPone support team at the first time if you got the defective item.【Please click on “VinPone”next to “Sold by”,then click on“Ask a question”to contact us, we will reach out to you within 24 hours.】"
  },
